        <div class="ab-copy">
          <p>Nuad Thai Spa Kathmandu grew from one location to four branches the way most service businesses do: one good year at a time, with the booking system never catching up.</p>
          <p>The owner&rsquo;s mornings went on calling each branch to find out who was booked, who showed up and what was collected. Discounts were verbal. Staff moved between branches with a phone call.</p>
          <p>We built Zennly around those four branches, and they still run on it today.</p>
        </div>
